<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>청주도시공사 체육시설 통합 매뉴얼 (Command Center)</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Lucide Icons CDN -->
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
    
    <style>
        /* 커스텀 테마 색상 설정 */
        :root {
            --color-primary: #10b981; /* emerald-500 */
            --color-secondary: #6366f1; /* indigo-500 */
        }
        
        /* 전체 다크 배경 및 은은한 격자 패턴 */
        body {
            background-color: #0b111a; /* Very Dark Blue-Gray */
            color: #f3f4f6; /* Light Gray Text */
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
            background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,.05) 1px, transparent 0);
            background-size: 40px 40px;
        }

        /* 공통 모듈 호버 효과 */
        .neon-module {
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
            position: relative;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .neon-module:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
            border-color: var(--color-primary);
        }

        /* 텍스트 네온 효과 */
        .neon-text-shadow {
            text-shadow: 0 0 4px var(--color-primary), 0 0 10px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.5);
        }
        
        /* 인덱스 항목 스타일 */
        .index-item {
            border-left: 3px solid transparent;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .index-item:hover {
            background-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
            border-left-color: var(--color-primary);
            color: white;
        }

        /* 모듈 토글 버튼 회전 */
        .rotate-180 {
            transform: rotate(180deg);
        }
        
        /* 콘텐츠 영역 스타일 (불러온 HTML 스타일 보정) */
        #content-area {
            color: #e5e7eb; /* gray-200 */
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        #content-area h1, #content-area h2, #content-area h3 {
            color: #10b981; /* emerald-500 */
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        #content-area table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: #d1d5db;
        }
        #content-area th, #content-area td {
            border: 1px solid #374151;
            padding: 0.75rem;
        }
        #content-area th {
            background-color: #1f2937;
            color: #10b981;
        }
        #content-area a {
            color: #38bdf8;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="p-4 sm:p-8">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <!-- 헤더 및 타이틀 -->
        <header class="text-center py-12 mb-10 border-b border-gray-700/50 relative">
            <!-- Firebase Connection Status -->
            <div class="absolute top-4 right-4">
                <button onclick="testConnection()" 
                        id="firebaseStatus" 
                        class="flex items-center space-x-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-700 transition cursor-pointer"
                        title="클릭하여 Firebase 연결 테스트">
                    <div id="statusDot" class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500 animate-pulse"></div>
                    <span id="statusText" class="text-sm text-gray-300">연결 확인 중...</span>
                    <i data-lucide="database" class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-400"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
            
            <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white neon-text-shadow">
                SPORTS FACILITY <span class="text-emerald-400">COMMAND CENTER</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="mt-4 text-xl font-light text-gray-400">
                청주도시공사 체육시설 통합 운영 매뉴얼
            </p>
        </header>

        <!-- 메인 레이아웃 -->
        <main class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
            
            <!-- 1. 좌측 패널: 시설 인덱스 (Facility Index) -->
            <section class="lg:col-span-1 neon-module bg-gray-900 p-6 shadow-xl h-fit">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-emerald-400 border-b border-gray-700 pb-3">
                    <i data-lucide="map-pin" class="w-6 h-6 inline mr-2 align-text-bottom"></i>시설 바로가기
                </h2>
                
                <nav class="space-y-2">
                    <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase text-gray-500 tracking-widest mb-4">청주도시공사 관리 시설</h3>
                    
                    <div onclick="loadContent('cheongjuSwimming_guide')" class="index-item block p-3 rounded text-gray-300">
                        <i data-lucide="droplet" class="w-4 h-4 inline mr-2 align-text-bottom text-emerald-400"></i> 청주수영장
                    </div>
                    
                    <div onclick="loadContent('purmi_guide')" class="index-item block p-3 rounded text-gray-300">
                        <i data-lucide="waves" class="w-4 h-4 inline mr-2 align-text-bottom text-emerald-400"></i> 푸르미스포츠센터
                    </div>
                    
                    <div onclick="loadContent('youngun_sportscenter_guide')" class="index-item block p-3 rounded text-gray-300">
                        <i data-lucide="activity" class="w-4 h-4 inline mr-2 align-text-bottom text-emerald-400"></i> 영운국민체육센터
                    </div>
                    
                    <div onclick="loadContent('bokdae_sportscenter_guide')" class="index-item block p-3 rounded text-gray-300">
                        <i data-lucide="building-2" class="w-4 h-4 inline mr-2 align-text-bottom text-emerald-400"></i> 복대국민체육센터
                    </div>
                    
                    <div onclick="loadContent('gagyeong_sportscenter_guide')" class="index-item block p-3 rounded text-gray-300">
                        <i data-lucide="building" class="w-4 h-4 inline mr-2 align-text-bottom text-emerald-400"></i> 가경국민체육센터
                    </div>
                </nav>
            </section>

            <!-- 2. 우측 패널: 대시보드 모듈 OR 콘텐츠 뷰어 -->
            <section class="lg:col-span-2">
                
                <!-- 2-A: 대시보드 모듈 뷰 (Dashboard View) -->
                <div id="dashboardView" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                    
                    <!-- 모듈 1: 매뉴얼 (Manual) -->
                    <div class="neon-module bg-gray-800 p-6 shadow-lg cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-700/50">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center" onclick="toggleModule('manualSelector', 'manualToggleIcon')">
                            <div>
                                <i data-lucide="book-open" class="w-10 h-10 mb-3 text-emerald-400"></i>
                                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1 text-emerald-300">매뉴얼 (Manual)</h2>
                                <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Admin, Tech, Safety Protocols</p>
                            </div>
                            <i id="manualToggleIcon" data-lucide="chevron-down" class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-400 transition-transform duration-300"></i>
                        </div>
                        
                        <!-- 매뉴얼 서브메뉴 -->
                        <div id="manualSelector" class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-gray-700 hidden">
                            <nav class="space-y-2">
                                <button onclick="loadContent('admin')" class="w-full text-left p-2 rounded bg-gray-700/50 text-emerald-200 hover:bg-emerald-600/50 transition">
                                    <i data-lucide="file-text" class="w-4 h-4 inline mr-2"></i> 행정 (Admin)
                                </button>
                                <button onclick="loadContent('tech')" class="w-full text-left p-2 rounded bg-gray-700/50 text-emerald-200 hover:bg-emerald-600/50 transition">
                                    <i data-lucide="cpu" class="w-4 h-4 inline mr-2"></i> 기술 (Tech)
                                </button>
                                <button onclick="loadContent('phy')" class="w-full text-left p-2 rounded bg-gray-700/50 text-emerald-200 hover:bg-emerald-600/50 transition">
                                    <i data-lucide="heart-pulse" class="w-4 h-4 inline mr-2"></i> 체육 (Physical)
                                </button>
                            </nav>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 모듈 2: VOC (고객의 소리) -->
                    <div class="neon-module bg-gray-800 p-6 shadow-lg cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-700/50">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center" onclick="toggleModule('vocSelector', 'vocToggleIcon')">
                            <div>
                                <i data-lucide="message-circle" class="w-10 h-10 mb-3 text-indigo-400"></i>
                                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1 text-indigo-300">VOC (고객의 소리)</h2>
                                <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Customer Feedback & Q&A</p>
                            </div>
                            <i id="vocToggleIcon" data-lucide="chevron-down" class="w-6 h-6 text-indigo-400 transition-transform duration-300"></i>
                        </div>

                        <!-- VOC 서브메뉴 -->
                        <div id="vocSelector" class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-gray-700 hidden">
                            <nav class="space-y-2">
                                <button onclick="loadContent('voc_swimming_pool')" class="w-full text-left p-2 rounded bg-gray-700/50 text-indigo-200 hover:bg-indigo-600/50 transition">
                                    수영장
                                </button>
                                <button onclick="loadContent('voc_multipurpose_sports_hall')" class="w-full text-left p-2 rounded bg-gray-700/50 text-indigo-200 hover:bg-indigo-600/50 transition">
                                    다목적체육관
                                </button>
                                <button onclick="loadContent('voc_program_room')" class="w-full text-left p-2 rounded bg-gray-700/50 text-indigo-200 hover:bg-indigo-600/50 transition">
                                    프로그램실
                                </button>
                                <button onclick="loadContent('voc_other_information')" class="w-full text-left p-2 rounded bg-gray-700/50 text-indigo-200 hover:bg-indigo-600/50 transition">
                                    기타
                                </button>
                            </nav>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 모듈 3: 현황 (Status) -->
                    <div class="neon-module bg-gray-800 p-6 shadow-lg cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-700/50">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center" onclick="toggleModule('statusSelector', 'statusToggleIcon')">
                            <div>
                                <i data-lucide="bar-chart-2" class="w-10 h-10 mb-3 text-yellow-400"></i>
                                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1 text-yellow-300">현황 (Status)</h2>
                                <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Updates & Facility Status</p>
                            </div>
                            <i id="statusToggleIcon" data-lucide="chevron-down" class="w-6 h-6 text-yellow-400 transition-transform duration-300"></i>
                        </div>

                        <!-- 현황 서브메뉴 -->
                        <div id="statusSelector" class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-gray-700 hidden">
                            <nav class="space-y-2">
                                <button onclick="loadContent('update')" class="w-full text-left p-2 rounded bg-gray-700/50 text-yellow-200 hover:bg-yellow-600/50 transition">
                                    업데이트 현황
                                </button>
                                <button onclick="loadContent('facility')" class="w-full text-left p-2 rounded bg-gray-700/50 text-yellow-200 hover:bg-yellow-600/50 transition">
                                    시설 현황
                                </button>
                            </nav>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 모듈 4: 도움말 (Help) -->
                    <div class="neon-module bg-gray-800 p-6 shadow-lg cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-700/50" onclick="loadContent('helpdesk')">
                        <i data-lucide="help-circle" class="w-10 h-10 mb-3 text-red-400"></i>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1 text-red-300">도움말 (Help)</h2>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Support & Contact</p>
                        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mt-2">시스템 이용 문의 및 개선 요청</p>
                    </div>

                </div>
                
                <!-- 2-B: 콘텐츠 뷰어 (Content Viewer) -->
                <div id="contentView" class="hidden">
                    <button onclick="showDashboard()" class="text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 mb-6 flex items-center transition duration-200 font-bold">
                        <i data-lucide="arrow-left" class="w-5 h-5 mr-2"></i> 메인 대시보드로 돌아가기
                    </button>
                    
                    <div id="content-area" class="neon-module bg-gray-800 p-8 shadow-2xl min-h-[500px]">
                        <!-- 여기에 동적으로 콘텐츠가 로드됩니다 -->
                        <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center h-full text-gray-500">
                            <i data-lucide="loader" class="w-10 h-10 animate-spin mb-4"></i>
                            <p>콘텐츠를 불러오는 중입니다...</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </section>

        </main>
    </div>

    <!-- Firebase SDK (Compat version 8.x) - LOCAL FILES -->
    <script src="lib/firebase-app-compat.js"></script>
    <script src="lib/firebase-firestore-compat.js"></script>

    <!-- Admin Authentication Modal -->
    <div id="adminAuthModal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/70 flex items-center justify-center z-50 p-4">
        <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-8 max-w-md w-full border border-gray-700 shadow-2xl">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-400 mb-6 flex items-center">
                <i data-lucide="lock" class="w-6 h-6 mr-3"></i>
                관리자 인증
            </h3>
            <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6">관리자 권한이 필요한 작업입니다. 비밀번호를 입력해주세요.</p>
            <input type="password" id="adminPassword" placeholder="비밀번호 입력" 
                   onkeydown="handleAdminPasswordKeydown(event)"
                   class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-gray-900 border border-gray-600 rounded-lg text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-amber-500 mb-2">
            <p id="adminAuthError" class="text-red-400 text-sm mb-4 hidden">❌ 비밀번호가 올바르지 않습니다.</p>
            <div class="flex space-x-3">
                <button onclick="checkAdminPassword()" class="flex-1 bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-500 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-lg transition">
                    확인
                </button>
                <button onclick="closeAdminAuthModal()" class="flex-1 bg-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-600 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-lg transition">
                    취소
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Confirm Modal -->
    <div id="confirmModal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/70 flex items-center justify-center z-50 p-4">
        <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-8 max-w-md w-full border border-gray-700 shadow-2xl">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-400 mb-6 flex items-center">
                <i data-lucide="alert-triangle" class="w-6 h-6 mr-3"></i>
                확인
            </h3>
            <p id="confirmMessage" class="text-gray-300 mb-6">정말로 실행하시겠습니까?</p>
            <div class="flex space-x-3">
                <button id="confirmYesBtn" class="flex-1 bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-500 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-lg transition">
                    예
                </button>
                <button onclick="closeConfirmModal()" class="flex-1 bg-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-600 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-lg transition">
                    아니오
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- VOC Write Modal -->
    <div id="vocWriteModal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/70 flex items-center justify-center z-50 p-4 overflow-y-auto">
        <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-8 max-w-2xl w-full border border-gray-700 shadow-2xl my-8">
            <h3 id="vocModalTitle" class="text-2xl font-bold text-indigo-400 mb-6 flex items-center">
                <i data-lucide="edit-3" class="w-6 h-6 mr-3"></i>
                VOC 작성
            </h3>
            
            <input type="hidden" id="voc-id">
            <input type="hidden" id="voc-firestore-id">
            <input type="hidden" id="voc-category">
            
            <div class="space-y-4">
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-gray-300 font-semibold mb-2">제목 *</label>
                    <input type="text" id="voc-title" placeholder="제목을 입력하세요" 
                           class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-gray-900 border border-gray-600 rounded-lg text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500">
                </div>
                
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-gray-300 font-semibold mb-2">작성자 *</label>
                    <input type="text" id="voc-author" placeholder="작성자명을 입력하세요" 
                           class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-gray-900 border border-gray-600 rounded-lg text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500">
                </div>
                
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-gray-300 font-semibold mb-2">내용 *</label>
                    <textarea id="voc-content" rows="6" placeholder="내용을 입력하세요" 
                              class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-gray-900 border border-gray-600 rounded-lg text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500 resize-none"></textarea>
                </div>
                
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-gray-300 font-semibold mb-2">답변 (선택)</label>
                    <textarea id="voc-answer" rows="4" placeholder="답변을 입력하세요 (관리자용)" 
                              class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-gray-900 border border-gray-600 rounded-lg text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-indigo-500 resize-none"></textarea>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex space-x-3 mt-6">
                <button onclick="saveVoc()" class="flex-1 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-lg transition flex items-center justify-center">
                    <i data-lucide="save" class="w-5 h-5 mr-2"></i>
                    저장
                </button>
                <button onclick="closeVocWriteModal()" class="flex-1 bg-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-600 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-lg transition">
                    취소
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Update Write Modal -->
    <div id="updateWriteModal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/70 flex items-center justify-center z-50 p-4 overflow-y-auto">
        <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-xl p-8 max-w-2xl w-full border border-gray-700 shadow-2xl my-8">
            <h3 id="updateModalTitle" class="text-2xl font-bold text-yellow-400 mb-6 flex items-center">
                <i data-lucide="file-edit" class="w-6 h-6 mr-3"></i>
                업데이트 작성
            </h3>
            
            <input type="hidden" id="update-id">
            <input type="hidden" id="update-firestore-id">
            
            <div class="space-y-4">
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-gray-300 font-semibold mb-2">제목 *</label>
                    <input type="text" id="update-title" placeholder="제목을 입력하세요" 
                           class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-gray-900 border border-gray-600 rounded-lg text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-yellow-500">
                </div>
                
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-gray-300 font-semibold mb-2">작성자 *</label>
                    <input type="text" id="update-author" placeholder="작성자명을 입력하세요" 
                           class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-gray-900 border border-gray-600 rounded-lg text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-yellow-500">
                </div>
                
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-gray-300 font-semibold mb-2">내용 *</label>
                    <textarea id="update-content" rows="8" placeholder="내용을 입력하세요" 
                              class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-gray-900 border border-gray-600 rounded-lg text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-yellow-500 resize-none"></textarea>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex space-x-3 mt-6">
                <button onclick="saveUpdate()" class="flex-1 bg-yellow-600 hover:bg-yellow-500 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-lg transition flex items-center justify-center">
                    <i data-lucide="save" class="w-5 h-5 mr-2"></i>
                    저장
                </button>
                <button onclick="closeUpdateWriteModal()" class="flex-1 bg-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-600 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-lg transition">
                    취소
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- External JavaScript Files -->
    <script src="js/system_v1.js"></script>
    <script src="js/common_v1.js"></script>
    <script src="js/ui_v1.js"></script>
    <script src="js/voc_v1.js"></script>
    <script src="js/status_v1.js"></script>
    <script src="js/manual_v1.js"></script>
    <script src="js/main_v1.js"></script>
    
    <script>
        // Lucide 아이콘 초기화
        lucide.createIcons();
    </script>
</body>
</html>
